@startuml
title Video Recording UI State Machine

skinparam handwritten false

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> WaitingForPermission : Clicks "Record"\n[Mutex Locked]

WaitingForPermission --> CountingDown : OS Permission Granted
WaitingForPermission --> Idle : Cancelled / Denied

CountingDown --> Recording : Delay Reaches 0
CountingDown --> Idle : User Clicks Cancel

Recording --> Paused : Clicks Pause
Recording --> Paused : AutoPause (Drill-Down Fetch)

Paused --> Recording : Clicks Resume
Paused --> Recording : AutoResume (Layout Ready)

Recording --> BlobCompiling : Clicks Stop / Max Duration
Paused --> BlobCompiling : Clicks Stop

BlobCompiling --> Idle : FileDownloadUtility triggers OS Save

note right of BlobCompiling
  Executes via the browser's Buffered 
  Mode. RAM is flushed, and the 
  encoder generates a 'Cues' 
  timeline index.
end note

@enduml